TensorFold
----------
This repository describes settings for the speech engine that drama-tensorfold
(https://github.com/plotarmordev/drama-tensorfold) builds from TensorFold (https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It contains none of their code or weights.

