Fish Audio
----------
Built with Fish Audio.

This repository contains no Fish Audio model weights and no codec checkpoint. It describes settings for the
Drama 3 model; users download the Drama 3 weights and codec checkpoint separately from Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/drama-3), or the NVFP4 pruned derivative
(https://huggingface.co/plotarmordev/drama-3-NVFP4-Pruned). Those files are licensed under the Fish Audio
Community License, Version 1.0
